# P12-MESH-004 solver robustness step 1: capture of the failing thermal systems (tools/bicg_capture.cpp, built against
# the PRE-FIX library). Replays the production thermal Picard loop on the campaign case (production SIMPLE, production
# ThermalSolverSettings: BiCGSTAB abs 1e-12 / rel 1e-10 / 1000); every outer solve is checked against an instrumented,
# operation-for-operation copy of BiCGSTAB::solve ('bit-identical' = same status, iterations and residual history);
# at the first breakdown runPicardLoop does not accept, the system is dumped (tests/data/linear_systems/ for the two
# 1024-unknown systems) and the instrumented copy prints every breakdown-tested scalar per iteration, relative to the
# norms of its factors.

